<title>JAPAN: Pioneer Electronic -1qtr group results.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Electronic -1qtr group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		129.81		vs	  128.98</p>
<p> Operating	prft 953 million	  vs     loss 1.11</p>
<p> Pretax		 2.35		vs	  766    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.03		vs	  804    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.71 yen	  vs	    4.48 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Pioneer Electronic Corp specialises in audio equipment. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
